19922fcab07638e217c85044af5a4744ff00ac3f.source:
* This skill will remove existing Crippled when used, although this is not stated in its description. This is similar to other skills that provide immunity to a condition, except for Frigid Armor.

Similarly to Illusionary Weaponry and Mantra of Signets, the armor provided by this skill is only applied at the end of the armor calculation. As such, it is not counted in the bonus armor cap of +25 and is not reduced by Armor penetration.

{{DEFAULTSORT:I am unstoppable!}}

19922fcab07638e217c85044af5a4744ff00ac3f.text:
* 此技能在使用時將刪除現有的 殘癈，儘管其描述中沒有說明。這與提供某種狀況免疫力的其他技能類似，冰凍護甲 除外。

與幻象武器和紋章頌歌類似，此技能提供的護甲僅在護甲運算結束時套用。因此，它不計入 +25 的額外護甲上限，也不會被 防禦穿透 減少。

{{DEFAULTSORT：我勢不可擋！ }}

5b72c288312c387ced1beb1d3dcdd32c0a65d367.source:
*Commonly used in Heroes' Ascent as an unstrippable speed boost for running relics.
*Popular in the Jade Quarry as a way to speed up the Carrier Juggernaut or Hauler Turtle.

{{DEFAULTSORT:Make Haste!}}

5b72c288312c387ced1beb1d3dcdd32c0a65d367.text:
*常用於 英雄之路，作為執行文物的不可剝離的速度提升。
*在 翡翠礦場 中作為加速航空母艦巨無霸或搬運龜的一種方式而流行。

{{DEFAULTSORT：快點！ }}

aa9a7fee758284231d006c8676095ef6fbe28a05.source:
Instead of ending on attacks as stated, it ends after an ally takes armor-respecting damage 1…3…3 times.
*This shout only ends on the ally that takes damage.
{{DEFAULTSORT:Watch Yourself!}}

aa9a7fee758284231d006c8676095ef6fbe28a05.text:
它不是按照規定的攻擊結束，而是在盟友受到護甲尊重傷害 1…3…3 次後結束。
*這種喊叫只會在受到傷害的盟友身上結束。
{{DEFAULTSORT：注意自己！ }}

e984204d7745055bbdab7e5dcf06f3340a785439.source:
Because the recharge reduction of "None Shall Pass!" is applied after percentile reductions such as Quickening Zephyr, the recharge can be reduced below 0. The skill will display as 'recharging' indefinitely but actually can be used again after 10 minutes and 55 seconds, which indicates that Guild Wars uses an unsigned 16 bit integer to store the recharge time in hundredths of a second (216−1 cs = 65,535 cs = 10min 55.35s).

* Useful for kiting melee foes.
{{DEFAULTSORT:None Shall Pass!}}

e984204d7745055bbdab7e5dcf06f3340a785439.text:
因為《無人能通過！ 》的儲值減少了。在百分位數減少後應用，例如 活力微風 ，儲值可以減少到以下 0 。該技能會顯示為無限期“充電”，但實際上可以在充電後再次使用 10 分鐘和 55 秒，這表明 公會 Wars 使用無符號 16 位元整數，用於儲存以百分之一秒為單位的充電時間（ 216 - 1 CS = 65,535 CS = 10 分分鐘 55.35 s）。

* 對於風箏近戰敵人有用。
{{DEFAULTSORT：沒有人會通過！ }}

a49deec78a6225998a00d84837aca36e76c700b2.source:
* Some synergy with Bull's Charge.
* Combines especially well with Grapple, as it provides an easy knock-down, is a non-elite warrior skill with melee range, and "On Your Knees!" will also recharge any stance removed by Grapple.

{{DEFAULTSORT:On Your Knees!}}

a49deec78a6225998a00d84837aca36e76c700b2.text:
* 與 公牛突擊態勢 有一定的協同作用。
* 與抓鬥結合得特別好，因為它可以輕鬆擊倒，是一種具有近戰範圍的非精英戰士技能，並且“跪下！”也將為抓鬥移除的任何姿態重新充電。

{{DEFAULTSORT：跪下！ }}

51364aad7e4b6e66367ea8d1a99adb0922b2ff92.source:
{{speed|1|7|50|12}}
* Some synergy with "On Your Knees!".
* This stance can be maintained indefinitely under Dwarven Stability.

51364aad7e4b6e66367ea8d1a99adb0922b2ff92.text:
{{速度|1|7|50|12}}
* 與「On Your Knees!」有一定的協同作用。
* 在矮人穩定狀態下，該姿態可以無限期地保持。

9492a99142be6750874011e4f8adb5d13bc3a0df.source:
Similar to Migraine, this skill does not decrease the activation time of dagger attack skills. Recharge time of dagger attack skills are affected as the skill describes.
{{Outdated info|}}
;February 05, 2019 update; please verify changes to AI behavior.

9492a99142be6750874011e4f8adb5d13bc3a0df.text:
與頭痛類似，此技能不會減少匕首攻擊技能的啟動時間。匕首攻擊技能的充能時間會受到技能描述的影響。
{{過時的資訊|}}
；二月 05、2019 更新；請驗證 AI 行為的變更。

061f8f7c2432a51168054fdc473d0227c87678d1.source:
* This skill can fully refill its own adrenaline cost:
** at rank 6 or higher, with any effect that doubles adrenaline gain (i.e. Furious Sword Hilt or the skill "For Great Justice!" in PvE);
** at rank 14 or higher, with any effect that grants at least one extra strike of adrenaline (e.g. Dark Fury);
** at rank 17 or higher, by its own effect alone.

ae87f9ec2cf6e6fd7c36c39985edbe96818ddebc.source:
{{speed|1|8|33|12}}
* Using this skill with Expertise of 11 or 12 or above alongside Dwarven Stability allows it to be permanently maintained if your Deldrimor rank is 5 or 4, respectively.
* This skill is most often used for running and can be used with Dodge or similar skills for a non-stop speed boost.

ae87f9ec2cf6e6fd7c36c39985edbe96818ddebc.text:
{{速度|1|8|33|12}}
* 如果您的 戴爾狄摩 等級分別為 5 或 4，則將此技能與 11 或 12 或以上的 專精 以及矮人穩定性一起使用，可以永久保持該技能。
* 此技能最常用於跑步，可與 閃避 或類似技能一起使用，實現不間斷的速度提升。

54ea5c495cb06477c834eb9715f4b2fccdc2964a.source:
* The self-recharging effect occurs even if disabled by skills such as Diversion or Blackout.
* This is a very effective feeder enchantment, since it has no effective recharge time and can provide for its own energy costs.

{{/table}}

54ea5c495cb06477c834eb9715f4b2fccdc2964a.text:
* 即使被牽制或意識喪失等技能停用，自我充能效果也會發生。
* 這是一個非常有效的餵食結界，因為它沒有有效的充電時間，並且可以提供自己的能量消耗。

{{/表}}

5f55165baba4f3050b2f4d8f65e107e7a1240ad5.source:
* Works well with Snow Storm, and Winter.
* This hex will end on the target if the caster dies.

{{research needed|Is the concise description incorrect or can this skill interrupt actions?}}

5f55165baba4f3050b2f4d8f65e107e7a1240ad5.text:
* 與 Snow Storm 和 寒冬 配合良好。
* 如果施法者死亡，這個六角形會在目標上結束。

{{需要研究|簡潔的描述是否不正確或該技能會打斷行動嗎？ }}

0aadad7280244aef975217aefeb48716c4a64283.source:
