* The target does not suffer the conditional damage from a block.
{{Skill change}}

0aadad7280244aef975217aefeb48716c4a64283.text:
* 極地之眼中有一個同名的怪物技能。
* 目標不會受到格擋造成的條件傷害。
{{技能 更改}}

333308ee9b5e8ca7a1b6740d5424801591abdfac.source:
{{speed|8|20|25|20}}
* The energy gain is triggered by any elemental damage packet, even when that damage is 0.
* Good synergy with Stone Striker or Greater Conflagration.

333308ee9b5e8ca7a1b6740d5424801591abdfac.text:
{{速度|8|20|25|20}}
* 能量增益由任何元素傷害套件觸發，即使該傷害是 0。
* 與 石之打擊 或更大的 火靈 具有良好的協同作用。

b268bdf810d77bf142a3eae70d24c58a7e72a3dd.source:
Similar to Ward of Weakness, this ward spell's recharge time cannot be decreased. For example, activating this ward spell while under the effects of Glyph of Renewal or Glyph of Swiftness will consume the glyph, but the recharge time will not be decreased. However, the recharge time can be increased, e.g., by Glyph of Sacrifice.
{{Outdated info|}}
;February 05, 2019 update; please verify changes to AI behavior.

b268bdf810d77bf142a3eae70d24c58a7e72a3dd.text:
與 虛弱 的守衛類似，此守衛法術的充能時間無法減少。例如，在迅捷的 再生符號 或 符號 效果下啟動此守衛法術會消耗雕文，但充能時間不會減少。然而，可以增加充電時間，例如透過 犧牲符號。
{{過時的資訊|}}
;February 05, 2019 update;請驗證 AI 行為的變更。

8abb57d2e8a2f07476ab125c2ace57c127b722ce.source:
*This is one of several skills that can remove enchantments that prevent spell targeting.
*The damage is dealt after the enchantment removal.
{{Skill change}}

8abb57d2e8a2f07476ab125c2ace57c127b722ce.text:
*這是可以消除阻止法術瞄準的結界的幾種技能之一。
